            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geboren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The birth date is used for children's check-ups (U3-U11, J1).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Geburtsdatum wird für die Kinder-Vorsorge (U3–U11, J1) verwendet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Health conditions": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gesundheitszustände"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used for the meal plan only: dishes that fit come more often, strict ones (coeliac disease, pregnancy) are never suggested, and the meal shows a tip for this person.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nur für den Essensplan: Passende Gerichte kommen öfter, strenge Regeln (Zöliakie, Schwangerschaft) werden nie verletzt, und beim Gericht steht ein Tipp für diese Person."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allergies & intolerances": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allergien & Unverträglichkeiten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dishes with these are never suggested. The catalogue is a guide - always check labels.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gerichte damit werden nie vorgeschlagen. Der Katalog ist eine Orientierung – Etiketten immer prüfen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Emergency card": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notfallkarte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blood type": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
